<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Qualitative Analysis of Generated Images</h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A5.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ E.2 Broader impact ‣ Appendix E Discussion ‣ Diffusion-Classifier Synergy: Reward-Aligned Learning via Mutual Boosting Loop for FSCIL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> displays a qualitative comparison, where the first column shows original images from the <span id="A3.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">mini</span>ImageNet dataset and the remaining columns show examples generated by our method. Guided by text prompts and our multi-faceted reward system, the generated images are not only semantically correct but are also rich in scenic diversity.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Incremental Computation of Reward Functions</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section details the incremental update rules for the Prototype-Anchored Maximum Mean Discrepancy Reward (<math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>PAMMD</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}</annotation></semantics></math>) and the Dimension-Wise Variance Matching Reward (<math id="A4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VM</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}</annotation></semantics></math>). These rules allow for efficient computation as the diffusion model generates images sequentially. We denote the feature vector of the <math id="A4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-th generated image as <math id="A4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Incremental Computation of <math id="A4.SS1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>PAMMD</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}</annotation></semantics></math></h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Recall the <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>PAMMD</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}</annotation></semantics></math> formula for a set of <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> generated features <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(N)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math> and a class prototype <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\mu}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\mu}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A4.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}({\bm{x}_{\text{gen}}},\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(c,N)})=-\frac{\alpha}{N^{2}}\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{N}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{z}_{j})}_{\text{Diversity}}+\frac{\beta}{N}\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{N}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{\mu}_{c})}_{\text{Consistency}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>PAMMD</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Diversity</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Consistency</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}({\bm{x}_{\text{gen}}},\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(c,N)})=-\frac{\alpha}{N^{2}}\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{N}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{z}_{j})}_{\text{Diversity}}+\frac{\beta}{N}\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{N}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{\mu}_{c})}_{\text{Consistency}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We need to incrementally update term <span id="A4.SS1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Diversity</span> and term <span id="A4.SS1.p1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Consistency</span> when a new <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(N)</annotation></semantics></math>-th feature <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math> is generated and added to a set of <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> existing features.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Let</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A4.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(N-1)}=\text{Diversity}_{N-1}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}\sum_{j=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{z}_{j})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Diversity</mtext><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(N-1)}=\text{Diversity}_{N-1}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}\sum_{j=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{z}_{j}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(N-1)}=\text{Consistency}_{N-1}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{\mu}_{c})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Consistency</mtext><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(N-1)}=\text{Consistency}_{N-1}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{\mu}_{c}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(1) Initialization (<math id="A4.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=0</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Before any image is generated for the class:</p>
<table id="A4.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(0)}=0," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(0)}=0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(0)}=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(0)}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(2) First Sample (<math id="A4.SS1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=1</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p7.1" class="ltx_p">When the first image feature <math id="A4.SS1.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> is generated:</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A4.E21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(1)}=k(\bm{z}_{1},\bm{z}_{1})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(1)}=k(\bm{z}_{1},\bm{z}_{1}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(1)}=k(\bm{z}_{1},\bm{\mu}_{c})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(1)}=k(\bm{z}_{1},\bm{\mu}_{c}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(3) Subsequent Samples (<math id="A4.SS1.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p10.1" class="ltx_p">Assume we have <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(N-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(N-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> samples, and a new feature <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math> is generated. The new sum <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(N)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math> includes the old sum <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(N-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math>, the self-similarity of the new sample <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{N})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{N})</annotation></semantics></math>, and twice the sum of similarities between the new sample and all <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> previous samples (due to symmetry <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{i})+k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{z}_{N})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{i})+k(\bm{z}_{i},\bm{z}_{N})</annotation></semantics></math> where <math id="A4.SS1.p10.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> is symmetric:</p>
<table id="A4.E23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(N)}=S_{D}^{(N-1)}+k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{N})+2\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{i})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(N)}=S_{D}^{(N-1)}+k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{N})+2\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{i}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p11.1" class="ltx_p">The new sum <math id="A4.SS1.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(N)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math> is the old sum <math id="A4.SS1.p11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(N-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math> plus the similarity of the new sample to the prototype:</p>
<table id="A4.E24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(N)}=S_{C}^{(N-1)}+k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{\mu}_{c})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(N)}=S_{C}^{(N-1)}+k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{\mu}_{c}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p12" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p12.1" class="ltx_p">With <math id="A4.SS1.p12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{D}^{(N)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{D}^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.SS1.p12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{C}^{(N)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{C}^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math>, the <math id="A4.SS1.p12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}(\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(N)},\bm{\mu}_{c})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>PAMMD</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{PAMMD}}(\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(N)},\bm{\mu}_{c})</annotation></semantics></math> can be calculated using the <a href="#A4.E16" title='In D.1 Incremental Computation of ℛ_"PAMMD" ‣ Appendix D Incremental Computation of Reward Functions ‣ Diffusion-Classifier Synergy: Reward-Aligned Learning via Mutual Boosting Loop for FSCIL' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>.
To compute <math id="A4.SS1.p12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}k(\bm{z}_{N},\bm{z}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math>, we need access to the feature vectors of the <math id="A4.SS1.p12.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> previously accepted images.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Incremental Computation of <math id="A4.SS2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VM</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}</annotation></semantics></math></h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Recall the <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VM</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}</annotation></semantics></math> for a candidate <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math> when added to a set of <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> generated features, forming an augmented set <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(N)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A4.E25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E25.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}({\bm{x}_{\text{gen}}},\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(c,N)})=-\sum_{d=1}^{D}\left(v_{\text{gen},[d]}-v_{\text{real},[d]}\right)^{2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VM</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></munderover><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>real</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}({\bm{x}_{\text{gen}}},\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}^{(c,N)})=-\sum_{d=1}^{D}\left(v_{\text{gen},[d]}-v_{\text{real},[d]}\right)^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{gen},[d]}=\text{Var}(\{f(\bm{x}_{j})^{d}\mid\bm{x}_{j}\in\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}\})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{gen},[d]}=\text{Var}(\{f(\bm{x}_{j})^{d}\mid\bm{x}_{j}\in\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}\})</annotation></semantics></math> is the sample variance of the <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>-th dimension of features in <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{\text{gen}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{real},[d]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>real</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{real},[d]}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined analogously.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The sample variance for a set of <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> values <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\bm{z}_{1},\dots,\bm{z}_{N}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\bm{z}_{1},\dots,\bm{z}_{N}\}</annotation></semantics></math> is given by:
<span id="A4.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
<table id="A4.E26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Var}(\{\bm{z}_{i}\})=\frac{1}{N-1}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(\bm{z}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}})^{2}=\frac{1}{N-1}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\bm{z}_{i}^{2}-N\bar{\bm{z}}^{2}\right)=\frac{1}{N-1}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\bm{z}_{i}^{2}-\frac{1}{N}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\bm{z}_{i}\right)^{2}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">Var</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></munderover><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo lspace="0em" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo lspace="0em" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><munderover><mo lspace="0em" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></munderover><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝒛</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Var}(\{\bm{z}_{i}\})=\frac{1}{N-1}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(\bm{z}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}})^{2}=\frac{1}{N-1}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\bm{z}_{i}^{2}-N\bar{\bm{z}}^{2}\right)=\frac{1}{N-1}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\bm{z}_{i}^{2}-\frac{1}{N}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\bm{z}_{i}\right)^{2}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=1</annotation></semantics></math>, variance is typically undefined or taken as 0. We consider <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\geq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math> for variance calculation. To compute <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{gen},[d]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{gen},[d]}</annotation></semantics></math> incrementally for dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>, when a new feature <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math> (with <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>-th component <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z_{N,[d]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z_{N,[d]}</annotation></semantics></math>) is added, we need to maintain the sum of values and the sum of squared values for each dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> of the generated features.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">For each dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\in\{1,\dots,D\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\in\{1,\dots,D\}</annotation></semantics></math>, the sum of feature values in dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A4.SS2.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> samples is:</p>
<table id="A4.E27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N-1)}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}z_{i,[d]}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N-1)}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}z_{i,[d]}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p4.2" class="ltx_p">The sum of squared feature values in dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A4.SS2.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> samples is:</p>
<table id="A4.E28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N-1)}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}(z_{i,[d]})^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N-1)}=\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}(z_{i,[d]})^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(1) Initialization (<math id="A4.SS2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=0</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Before any image is generated, for each dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A4.E29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Sum}_{d}^{(0)}=0," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Sum}_{d}^{(0)}=0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(0)}=0," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(0)}=0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{gen},[d]}=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{gen},[d]}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(2) First Sample (<math id="A4.SS2.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=1</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p">When the first feature <math id="A4.SS2.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> is generated:</p>
<table id="A4.E32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Sum}_{d}^{(1)}=z_{1,[d]}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Sum}_{d}^{(1)}=z_{1,[d]},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(1)}=(z_{1,[d]})^{2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(1)}=(z_{1,[d]})^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E34" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{gen},[d]}=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{gen},[d]}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(3) Subsequent Samples (<math id="A4.SS2.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p10.1" class="ltx_p">Assume we have <math id="A4.SS2.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.SS2.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A4.SS2.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> samples, and a new feature <math id="A4.SS2.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{z}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{z}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math> (with <math id="A4.SS2.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>-th component <math id="A4.SS2.p10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z_{N,[d]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z_{N,[d]}</annotation></semantics></math>) is generated:</p>
<table id="A4.E35" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N)}=\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N-1)}+z_{N,[d]}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N)}=\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N-1)}+z_{N,[d]},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(35)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E36" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N)}=\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N-1)}+(z_{N,[d]})^{2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N)}=\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N-1)}+(z_{N,[d]})^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A4.E37" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{gen},[d]}=\frac{1}{N-1}\left(\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N)}-\frac{1}{N}(\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N)})^{2}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SumSq</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mtext>Sum</mtext><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{gen},[d]}=\frac{1}{N-1}\left(\text{SumSq}_{d}^{(N)}-\frac{1}{N}(\text{Sum}_{d}^{(N)})^{2}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p11.1" class="ltx_p">With <math id="A4.SS2.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{\text{gen},[d]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mtext>gen</mtext><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{\text{gen},[d]}</annotation></semantics></math> calculated for all dimensions <math id="A4.SS2.p11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> using the updated sums, the <math id="A4.SS2.p11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VM</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{VM}}</annotation></semantics></math> can be computed.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Discussion</h2>

<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Limitations</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The proposed framework’s performance is contingent upon access to high-quality, pre-trained diffusion models. Furthermore, the efficacy of DCS may be reduced when applied to highly specialized domains poorly represented in the diffusion model’s training data, and the framework’s multi-component reward system and iterative boosting loop introduce complexities in tuning and computational demand.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Broader impact</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The DCS framework is a foundational research contribution aimed at improving the adaptability of machine learning models in data-scarce, continual learning settings. As the approach leverages a pre-trained diffusion model, the nature and characteristics of the generated images are directly determined by this underlying component. Consequently, the framework inherits any potential societal impacts, such as fairness considerations or biases, from the foundational model it employs. The safety and security of the generated content are therefore contingent on the specific diffusion model used, and we encourage practitioners to consider the ethical implications of the foundational model selected for any given application.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.03608v1/generate_images.png" id="A5.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/613;" width="476" height="613" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="A5.F4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparison of real and generated images on <span id="A5.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">mini</span>ImageNet. The first column displays real images from the dataset. The subsequent columns show diverse and semantically correct images generated by our DCS framework for the corresponding classes.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
</article>
</div>
</div>
